WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.380
Point people: your station page.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:10.161
Open the link the coordinators emailed you. Keep it to yourself; it shows volunteers' phone numbers.

00:00:10.361 --> 00:00:14.640
Group texts open your phone's messaging app with everyone in it.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.667
Text everyone on your station today,

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:23.420
or just one block. Copy numbers copies them, if your phone's app won't open.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:29.839
Each volunteer has Call and Text buttons. Texts start with their name, so they know it's you.

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:36.320
When they show up, tap Check in. Didn't show? No-show. That's how the coordinators know who worked.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:46.216
If you coordinate guides, pick each guide's guard ahead of time. Their screen opens right on it. Anyone without one picks from the pool on the day.

00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:49.460
You can also text the guide for one guard.

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:55.820
Questions on the day? Go to the coordinators. They're the ones who reach the directors.
